        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The players are members of a covert counter-terrorist team of mercenaries known as the \"Wolf Force\". The aim of the game was to rescue the former President from rebels in the fictional African country of Zutula, which bears resemblance to the apartheid regime in South Africa. The game has six main levels, plus the final level where your mission is to rescue the former U.S. president from the Hercules Transport. The game's arsenal include real-world machine guns, shot guns, flame throwers, and grenade launchers. Several missions even have pilotable vehicles available.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Los jugadores son miembros de un equipo encubierto antiterrorista de mercenarios conocido como «Wolf Force». El objetivo del juego es rescatar al expresidente de los rebeldes en el país africano ficticio de Zutula, que recuerda al régimen del apartheid en Sudáfrica. El juego tiene seis niveles principales, además del nivel final, en el que la misión consiste en rescatar al expresidente de Estados Unidos del Hercules Transport. El arsenal incluye ametralladoras, escopetas, lanzallamas y lanzagranadas reales. Varias misiones incluso tienen vehículos pilotables disponibles.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1990",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
