        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Several levels await your super-tough Commando in this arcade conversion. Armed with only a standard rifle and a few grenades you must take on hordes of enemies. Some are wandering around in the open, while others have picked out hiding places, which you must approach from certain angles. Trees, rivers and bridges create a varied combat-like terrain and must be incorporated into your thinking. Extra grenades can be collected, and will definitely be required, as they allow you to kill from distance and thus avoid some enemy shots.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Varios niveles aguardan a tu Commando, superduro, en esta conversión de recreativa. Armado solo con un rifle estándar y unas pocas granadas, debes enfrentarte a hordas de enemigos. Algunos deambulan a campo abierto, mientras que otros han elegido escondites a los que debes acercarte desde ciertos ángulos. Árboles, ríos y puentes crean un terreno de combate variado que debes tener en cuenta en tu estrategia. Se pueden recoger granadas extra, que serán imprescindibles, ya que permiten matar a distancia y evitar algunos disparos enemigos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1985",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
